  "slug": "my-roommate",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/14266_my-roommate.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "My roommate is a Frenchman. He is 25 years old. Because he likes Chinese culture, he wants to work and live in China. But he doesn’t speak Chinese, and many jobs here require him to speak Chinese, so he is now learning Chinese while looking for a job. He sometimes rests at home during the day and sometimes goes to school for classes; at night he often goes to a bar to drink with friends and doesn't come back until very late. On weekends he gets up very late, so we cook dinner together and watch movies together in the evening. He has a Chinese test every month. When the test is about to take place, I will also help him review Chinese. Now his Chinese is getting better and better, and he will be able to take the HSK Level 4 test next year. I hope he goes well in the exam and can find a good job."
  ],
  "english_full": "My roommate is a Frenchman. He is 25 years old. Because he likes Chinese culture, he wants to work and live in China. But he doesn’t speak Chinese, and many jobs here require him to speak Chinese, so he is now learning Chinese while looking for a job. He sometimes rests at home during the day and sometimes goes to school for classes; at night he often goes to a bar to drink with friends and doesn't come back until very late. On weekends he gets up very late, so we cook dinner together and watch movies together in the evening. He has a Chinese test every month. When the test is about to take place, I will also help him review Chinese. Now his Chinese is getting better and better, and he will be able to take the HSK Level 4 test next year. I hope he goes well in the exam and can find a good job.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Мо́й сосе́д по кварти́ре фра́нцуз. Ему́ 25 лет. Потому́ что он люби́т кита́йскую культу́ру, он жела́ет рабо́тать и живо́ть в Кита́е. Но он не говорит по-кита́йски, а много́е де́ло здесь требу́ет, чтобы он говорил по-кита́йски, поэ́тому сейча́с он учи́тся говорить по-кита́йски, пока́ ищет рабо́ту. Он иногда́ отдыха́ет до́ма в течени́е дня и иногда́ ходи́т в шко́лу на за́нятия; но́чью он ча́сто ходи́т в бар, чтобы пить с друзья́ми и не возвраща́ется до по́здно. На вы́ходных он встаёт о́чень по́здно, поэ́тому мы гото́вим у́жин вместе́ и смо́трим фи́льмы вече́ром. У него́ кита́йский те́ст ка́ждый ме́сяц. Когда́ те́ст собира́ется сла́читься, я тоже́ помогу́ ему́ пересмо́тр кита́йский. Сейча́с его́ кита́йский ста́ет лу́чше и лу́чше, и он смо́жет сдать те́ст HSK уро́вня 4 в сле́дующем году́. Я наде́юсь, что он сdáст экза́мен и смо́жет найти́ хоро́шую рабо́ту."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Mój sosézd po kvartíre frant͡suz. Yemú 25 let. Potomú chto on lyubít kitáyskuyu kultúru, on zheláyet rabotá́tʹ i zhivótʹ v Kitáye. No on ne govorít po-kitáyski, a mnógoye délo zdesʹ trebúyet, chtoby on govoríl po-kitáyski, poetómu seychás on úchitsya govorítʹ po-kitáyski, pokak íshét rabótú. On inogdá otdikháyet dóma v techeníye dnyá i inogdá khodít v shkolú na zanyátiya; nóchʹú on chásto khodít v bar, chtoby pítí s drúzyámi i ne vozvrashcháetsya do pо́zdno. Na vykhodnýkh on vstáyot óchénʹ pózdno, poetómu my gotóvim úzhin vmésté i smotrím fílny vechéróm. U negó kitáyskíy tést kázhdyy méсяc. Kogdá tést sobiráyetsya sláchítʹ, ya tózhe pomogú emú persmótr kitáyskíy. Seichás egó kitáyskíy stáyet lúchshe i lúchshe, i on smozhét sdátʹ tést HSK urov́nya 4 v sléduyushchem godú. Ya nadéyusʹ, chto on sdást ekzámen i smozhét naytí khoroshúyu rabótú."
  ],
